{
  "vagon_recipes": 1,
  "_comment": "Audi A3 8Y (MQB-Evo, MIB3). Statuses: community-mqb = byte/bit from MQB (non-Evo) guides, needs-labels = named adaptation channels that must be learned on YOUR car first (vagon learn) or imported from ODX. Nothing here was verified on a real 8Y by the VagOn authors — always check the plan, VagOn backs up before every write.",
  "recipes": [
    {
      "id": "cockpit.needle_sweep",
      "category": "cockpit",
      "title": {
        "ru": "Приветствие стрелками (Needle sweep / Staging)",
        "en": "Needle sweep (staging)"
      },
      "description": {
        "ru": "Стрелки/шкалы пробегают до максимума при включении зажигания.",
        "en": "Gauges sweep to max when the ignition is switched on."
      },
      "module": "17",
      "status": "community-mqb",
      "sfd": "likely",
      "cars": [
        "8V",
        "Golf 7",
        "8Y?"
      ],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "coding_bit",
          "byte": 1,
          "bit": 0,
          "on": 1,
          "off": 0
        }
      ],
      "notes": {
        "ru": "Byte 1 Bit 0 «Gauge test / Staging active» — классическое место на MQB. Владельцы 8Y/Golf 8 с цифровой панелью часто сообщают, что видимого эффекта нет. Безвредно: откат одной кнопкой.",
        "en": "Classic MQB location. Often no visible effect on MQB-Evo digital clusters."
      },
      "after": {
        "ru": "Выключите и включите зажигание.",
        "en": "Cycle the ignition."
      },
      "sources": [
        "https://vagupdate.com/blog/general/enable-staging",
        "https://vwcoding.ru/en/MQB/AID/",
        "https://github.com/xodq/clusterleg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cockpit.traffic_sign_display",
      "category": "cockpit",
      "title": {
        "ru": "Дорожные знаки в приборной панели",
        "en": "Traffic signs in the cluster"
      },
      "description": {
        "ru": "Признак «распознавание знаков установлено» в приборке (нужна фронтальная камера с этой функцией).",
        "en": "Cluster: traffic sign recognition installed (needs a camera with TSR)."
      },
      "module": "17",
      "status": "community-mqb",
      "sfd": "likely",
      "cars": [
        "Golf 7",
        "A4 B9",
        "8V"
      ],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "coding_bit",
          "byte": 5,
          "bit": 2,
          "on": 1,
          "off": 0
        }
      ],
      "notes": {
        "ru": "Byte 5 Bit 2 «Traffic Sign Recognition installed» по гайдам MQB/MLB. На 8Y знаки обычно уже включены с завода при наличии камеры.",
        "en": "Byte 5 Bit 2 per MQB/MLB guides."
      },
      "sources": [
        "https://github.com/LateAlways/mibwiki-mirror (MQB CODING / A5 - Front Assistant Camera Coding)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cockpit.lap_timer",
      "category": "cockpit",
      "title": {
        "ru": "Секундомер (Lap timer) в Virtual Cockpit",
        "en": "Lap timer in the Virtual Cockpit"
      },
      "module": "17",
      "status": "needs-labels",
      "sfd": "yes",
      "cars": [
        "Golf 8 (vwcoding.ru, SW 3460–3470)"
      ],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "Laptimer",
          "alt": [
            "Lap_timer",
            "Laptimer_active"
          ],
          "on": "activated",
          "off": "not activated"
        }
      ],
      "notes": {
        "ru": "На MQB-Evo включается адаптацией в 17 (Displayable_content_configuration → Laptimer). Точный DID на вашем блоке нужно выучить: vagon learn start 17 → включить в ODIS/OBDeleven → vagon learn finish 17 --name Laptimer --old \"not activated\" --new activated.",
        "en": "Adaptation on MQB-Evo; learn the channel first."
      },
      "sources": [
        "https://vwcoding.ru/en/MQB-Evo/AID/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mmi.wireless_carplay",
      "category": "mmi",
      "title": {
        "ru": "Беспроводной Apple CarPlay (MIB3)",
        "en": "Wireless Apple CarPlay (MIB3)"
      },
      "description": {
        "ru": "Включает Wi-Fi 5 ГГц / клиентский режим и беспроводной CarPlay в блоке 5F.",
        "en": "Enables 5 GHz Wi-Fi client mode and wireless CarPlay in 5F."
      },
      "module": "5F",
      "status": "needs-labels",
      "sfd": "yes",
      "cars": [
        "A3 8Y",
        "Golf 8"
      ],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "5_ghz_wlan",
          "on": "on",
          "off": "off"
        },
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "Wifi_client_mode_5GHz",
          "on": "on",
          "off": "off"
        },
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "WIFI_Hotspot_5GHz",
          "on": "on",
          "off": "off",
          "optional": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "WiFi_Client_HMI",
          "on": "on",
          "off": "off",
          "optional": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "Apple_DIO",
          "alt": [
            "Apple_car_play",
            "apple_car_play"
          ],
          "on": "activated",
          "off": "not activated"
        },
        {
          "kind": "channel",
          "channel": "Apple_DIO_Wireless",
          "alt": [
            "Apple_car_play_wireless"
          ],
          "on": "activated",
          "off": "not activated"
        }
      ],
      "notes": {
        "ru": "Нужно: MIB3 и уже работающий проводной CarPlay. Перед записью удалите iPhone из CarPlay и Bluetooth в MMI. Блок 5F на 8Y защищён SFD (по данным для Golf 8 с ПО 1803+). Часть блоков с завода/лицензией не даёт включить беспроводной режим. Каналы и их названия различаются по версиям ПО — выучите их на своей машине (по одному: vagon learn) или запишите весь набор, сделанный один раз в ODIS (vagon learn finish 5F --recipe-name ...).",
        "en": "Needs MIB3 + working wired CarPlay; 5F is SFD-protected on MQB-Evo."
      },
      "after": {
        "ru": "Перезагрузите MMI (удерживать кнопку громкости/питания ~10–15 с) и заново подключите iPhone.",
        "en": "Reboot the MMI and re-pair the phone."
      },
      "sources": [
        "https://www.vag-coding.net/audi/a3-8y/a3-8y-wireless-carplay-activation/",
        "https://www.vag-coding.net/vw/golf-8-5h/golf-8-5h-wireless-carplay-activation/",
        "https://forum.obdeleven.com/thread/17237"
      ]
    },
